## 4. Multi-Signal Query Parsing & Taxonomy Weights
*Source: `Fannon/search-bookmarks-history-and-tabs`*

- **Prefix Tokens**:
  - `~folder` -> restricts candidate pool to matching folder titles.
  - `#tag` -> matches extracted keywords or hash tokens.
  - `b ` / `h ` / `t ` -> filters source (Bookmarks, History, Active Tabs).
- **Composite Score Formula**:
  $$\text{FinalScore} = (1.5 \times S_{\text{titleExact}}) + (1.2 \times S_{\text{titlePrefix}}) + (0.8 \times S_{\text{urlMatch}}) + (0.5 \times S_{\text{taxonomy}}) + S_{\text{recencyBoost}}$$
